/-- The `(D^∞)^∞`-set reindexing a `D^∞`-neighbourhood `W`: `fiber2 (reindexF W) i j = fiber W (pair i j)`. -/
def reindexF (W : Set (ℕ × α)) : Set (ℕ × (ℕ × α)) :=
  {p | p.2.2 ∈ fiber W (Nat.pair p.1 p.2.1)}
end

